WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.201
One world, many maps. Switch between map styles and read the same geography.

2
00:00:03.201 --> 00:00:07.969
Open Map layers to explore different readings of your world.

3
00:00:07.969 --> 00:00:12.771
Choose Cartography for illustrated map styles.

4
00:00:12.771 --> 00:00:16.293
Choose Tolkien sepia for a warm, ink-on-parchment atlas.

5
00:00:16.293 --> 00:00:20.294
The style changes. Your coastlines and places stay connected.

6
00:00:20.294 --> 00:00:23.756
Switch to Swiss analytical relief to read the shape of the land.

7
00:00:23.756 --> 00:00:26.758
Try Climate & seasons for maps that explain the landscape.

8
00:00:26.758 --> 00:00:32.215
Choose Annual rainfall to compare wet and dry regions.

9
00:00:32.215 --> 00:00:36.200
Use the scale to read the values behind the colours.
